# Runtime dependency intent. The authoritative lock is `uv.lock`; regenerate the
# pip-compatible snapshot with:
#   uv lock
#   uv export --no-dev --format requirements.txt --no-hashes --no-header --no-emit-package opencv-python --no-emit-package opencv-python-headless --output-file requirements.txt
#
# OpenCV note:
# insightface / pyiqa may pull opencv-python transitively. The project pins the
# runtime-facing OpenCV package to contrib here; build scripts still reinstall
# opencv-contrib-python with --no-deps after dependency installation to prevent
# cv2 namespace collisions from transitive wheels.

